ce_text":"Base Period - SB-DBMACC\nFFP\nThis Indefinite Delivery/Indefinite Quantity (IDIQ) is a Design-Build Multiple\nAward Construction Contract (DBMACC) with a base period of 60 months and\nthree (3) 12-month option periods for a total maximum duration of 96 months. A\ntask order for the minimum guarantee is issued concurrently with the award of the\nbasic contract. A new delivery date for this DBMACC will be established upon\nexercise of an option. The maximum aggregate dollar value for all awarded\ncontracts, including the base period and all option periods, is $600,000,000. The\nactual amount of work to be ordered under this DBMACC and the time of such\nperformance will be determined by a contracting officer who will issue written\ntask orders. Funds will be obligated upon issuance of each individual task order.\nAll task orders, including those issued in any exercised option periods, shall be\nissued against this CLIN 0001.\nFOB: Destination\nPURCHASE REQUEST NUMBER: ACQR5858342\nPSC CD: Z1AZ","extraction_method":"schedule_table_layout","source_locator":null,"source_region_id":"line_items:0:description","anchor_text":"0001","highlight_text":"Base Period - SB-DBMACC"},"validation":{"status":"passed","checks":[{"check":"has_evidence","passed":true,"message":null}]},"review_status":"Verified","review_reasons":[],"source_column":null},"contract.data.value":{"canonical_field":"contract.data.value","display_label":"Description / Text","value":"Base Period - SB-DBMACC\nFFP\nThis Indefinite Delivery/Indefinite Quantity (IDIQ) is a Design-Build Multiple\nAward Construction Contract (DBMACC) with a base period of 60 months and\nthree (3) 12-month option periods for a total maximum duration of 96 months. A\ntask order for the minimum guarantee is issued concurrently with the award of the\nbasic contract. A new delivery date for this DBMACC will be established upon\nexercise of an option. The maximum aggregate dollar value for all awarded\ncontracts, including the base 